author=Jerickson Mayor
description=Systemless MT76x2U (MT7612U) USB 802.11ac driver + mt7662 firmware for SM-A066B. Loads the mt76 stack at boot and registers its firmware via the kernel firmware_class path override. No metamodule/overlay required.
